@startuml sequence_confirm_reservation
title Sequence — Confirm reservation (UC3)

actor Customer
participant API
participant DB
participant NotificationService

Customer -> API: POST /reservations/{id}/confirm
API -> DB: Re-check availability (query CONFIRMED reservations)
DB --> API: available / conflict

alt available
  API -> DB: Update reservation state -> CONFIRMED
  API -> NotificationService: send_confirmation(reservation, user)
  NotificationService --> Customer: confirmation (email/log)
  API --> Customer: 200 OK (reservation CONFIRMED)
else conflict
  API --> Customer: 409 Conflict (slot taken)
end

note over API,DB
  Re-check ensures last-minute conflicts are detected.
end note

@enduml
